# Eval results are runtime artifacts produced by every `--help`-style run
# (see evals/lib/results.ts); only the committed baselines under
# evals/baselines/ are persisted. The `runs/` files that were already
# committed before this rule was added are kept as historical traces
# (git ignores don't apply to already-tracked files).
evals/results/
# IDE-specific state — not part of the cast codebase.
